  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f96af9da-602f-53d3-b09b-233b2a0feaa6" activityNameId="624d21ef-efab-5de2-a87d-5860498396b7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, sewer system, HDPE pipe, SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: 611f81aa-6422-44c2-baab-4979be7aa181
This process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with HDPE-pipe. SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with HDPE-pipe, DN 600, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: SN 2-4, DN 600, profile 4 according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. HDPE-pipe, ID 555-570 mm, outer diameter 630 mm, wall thickness 30-37 mm , 52-63 kg/m, 910-950 kg/m³. 
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_611f81aa-6422-44c2-baab-4979be7aa181.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
